WEBVTT

1
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:21,020
It’s you who dares to dance in front of King Chaoyang for the first time in a mecha.

2
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:33,390
I'm sorry for Jian Junxun that day

3
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:38,190
I don’t know what I was thinking that day

4
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:40,430
My mind seems to have stopped spinning.

5
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:43,140
I just feel like it can't end there

6
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:45,670
I'm still not suitable for solo soldier dramas

7
00:00:47,090 --> 00:00:48,090
There's no need to think so

8
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:50,900
Teacher Jiaren and I discussed it.

9
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,660
My mentality is not suitable for being an individual soldier at least now.

10
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:55,420
So I decided to switch to logistics drama

11
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,780
No one wants their teammates to draw guns on them

12
00:00:58,260 --> 00:01:00,060
It was just an accident. It was really unnecessary.

13
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:02,060
Besides, we were hostile parties at the time, so your idea is reasonable.
